tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >FOC</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='volume_page.aspx?volume_id=2024&flora_id=2'  TARGET='_top' >FOC Vol. 24</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=10507'  TARGET='_top' >Liliaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=2&start_taxon_id=10507'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n55. <b>Liriope</b> Loureiro, Fl. Cochinch.  1: 190, 200.  1790.  \n<p>山麦冬属 shan mai dong shu \r\n<P>\r\nChen Xinqi (陈心启 Chen Sing-chi); Minoru N. Tamura\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nHerbs perennial, shortly rhizomatous, often stoloniferous. Roots sometimes with fleshy, tuberous part near tip. Leaves basal, tufted, sessile, grasslike or narrowly linear. Scape simple, naked, terminating in a reduced panicle. Flowers bisexual, often in clusters of 2--4, sometimes solitary, small, subtended by a bract and a few bracteoles; pedicel articulate. Tepals 6, free. Stamens 6, inserted at base of tepals; filaments narrowly linear; anthers basifixed. Ovary superior, 3-loculed; ovules 2 per locule. Style columnar, slightly 3-angled; stigma small. Fruit bursting irregularly at an early stage and exposing young seeds. Seeds deep blue to purple at maturity, berrylike, globose or ellipsoid.<p>\r\n\r\nAbout eight species, E Asia, extending to Japan, the Philippines, and Vietnam; six species (three endemic) in China.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Filaments ca. 2 × as long as anthers; leaves 1--2 mm wide</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>1 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027755'  TARGET='_top' >Liriope kansuensis</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Filaments equaling or slightly longer than anthers; leaves 2--35 mm wide.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-2'>2</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plants not stoloniferous.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Plants stoloniferous.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-3'>3</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Pedicel (5--)6--8 mm; anthers slightly shorter than filaments</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>4 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027756'  TARGET='_top' >Liriope longipedicellata</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Pedicel (2--)4--5 mm; anthers equaling filaments</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>6 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=240001436'  TARGET='_top' >Liriope muscari</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-4'>4</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Anthers ca. 2 mm</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>5 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027759'  TARGET='_top' >Liriope spicata</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Anthers 1--1.5 mm.</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-5'>(5)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-5'>5</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Inflorescence 1--3 cm</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>2 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027757'  TARGET='_top' >Liriope minor</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Inflorescence 6--15 cm</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP>3 <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027754'  TARGET='_top' >Liriope graminifolia</A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027754' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>graminifolia</b>  (Linnaeus) Baker</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027755' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>kansuensis</b>  (Batalin) C. H. Wright</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027756' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>longipedicellata</b>  F. T. Wang & Tang</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027757' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>minor</b>  (Maximowicz) Makino</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=240001436' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>muscari</b>  (Decaisne) L. H. Bailey</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=200027759' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>spicata</b>  Loureiro</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=250098030' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Liriope</b> <b>zhejiangensis</b>  G. H. Xia & G. Y. Li</A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                   